OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for sniffing young
OL,4,Agirls' feet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 24-year-old man who caused
OL,7,F"considerable distress" to young girls
OL,8,Fby grabbing their feet and sniffing
OL,9,Fthem has been sentenced.
OL,11,FAlexander Scott-Bowen, of Kingswood,
OL,12,FBristol, approached girls in the South
OL,13,FGloucestershire area between 2022 and
OL,14,F2025, paying them compliments before
OL,15,Fgrabbing and sniffing their feet.
OL,17,FPolice said Scott-Bowen, who pleaded
OL,18,Fguilty to seven counts of sexual
OL,19,Fassault, was linked to the assaults
OL,20,Fafter his DNA was found on the
OL,21,Fshoelaces of one of the victims.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
